{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "granthId": "dasam",
  "ang": 601,
  "lineCount": 24,
  "source": "BaniDB",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0001",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "gurmukhi": "ਡਲ ਡੋਲਸ ਸੰਕਤ ਸੇਸ ਥਿਰਾ ॥੪੯੭॥",
      "transliteration": "ddal ddolas sa(n)kat ses thiraa ||497||",
      "translation": "Remembering the war, the Yoginis are hailing and the trembling cowards of the Iron Age also became fearless, the hags are laughing violently and Sheshnaga, getting dubious, is wavering.497.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸ਼ੇਸ਼ਨਾਗ ਸ਼ੰਕਾਵਾਨ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ ਹੈ ਅਤੇ ਧਰਤੀ ਡੋਲ ਰਹੀ ਹੈ ॥੪੯੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "डल डोलस संकत सेस थिरा ॥४९७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100043",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0002",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਿਵ ਦੇਖਤ ਲੇਖਤ ਧਨਿ ਧਨੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhiv dhekhat lekhat dhan dhana(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੇਵਤੇ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਧੰਨ ਧੰਨ ਕਹਿੰਦੇ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दिव देखत लेखत धनि धनं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100044",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0003",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿਲਕੰਤ ਕਪਾਲਯਿ ਕ੍ਰੂਰ ਪ੍ਰਭੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kilaka(n)t kapaalay kraoor prabha(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬਹੁਤ ਭਿਆਨਕ ਸੂਰਤ ਵਾਲੀਆਂ ਕਪਾਲਨਾ ਕਿਲਕਾਰੀਆਂ ਮਾਰਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "किलकंत कपालयि क्रूर प्रभं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100045",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0004",
      "lineIndex": 4,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬ੍ਰਿਣ ਬਰਖਤ ਪਰਖਤ ਬੀਰ ਰਣੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "biran barakhat parakhat beer rana(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸੂਰਮਿਆਂ ਵਲੋਂ (ਰਣ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚ) ਜ਼ਖ਼ਮਾ ਦੀ ਬਰਖਾ ਕੀਤੀ ਜਾ ਰਹੀ ਹੈ (ਅਤੇ ਇਸ ਨਾਲ ਸੂਰਮਿਆਂ ਦੀ) ਪਰਖ ਹੋ ਰਹੀ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बृण बरखत परखत बीर रणं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100046",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0005",
      "lineIndex": 5,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹਯ ਘਲਤ ਝਲਤ ਜੋਧ ਜੁਧੰ ॥੪੯੮॥",
      "transliteration": "hay ghalat jhalat jodh judha(n) ||498||",
      "translation": "The gods are looking and saying “Bravo, bravo”, and the goddess getting glorious, is shouting, the flowing wounds inflicted by the swords are testing the warriors and the fighters alongwith their horses are enduring the cruelty of war.498.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸੂਰਮੇ ਘੋੜਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਘਾਇਲ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ ਅਤੇ ਯੁੱਧ ਵਿਚ (ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰਾ ਅਸਤ੍ਰਾ ਦੇ ਵਾਰਾ ਨੂੰ) ਝਲਦੇ ਵੀ ਹਨ ॥੪੯੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हय घलत झलत जोध जुधं ॥४९८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100047",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0006",
      "lineIndex": 6,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿਲਕੰਤ ਕਪਾਲਿਨ ਸਿੰਘ ਚੜੀ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kilaka(n)t kapaalin si(n)gh chaRee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸ਼ੇਰ ਉਤੇ ਸਵਾਰ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਕਪਾਲਿਨੀ ਦੇਵੀ ਕਿਲਕਾਰੀਆਂ ਮਾਰ ਰਹੀ ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "किलकंत कपालिन सिंघ चड़ी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100048",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0007",
      "lineIndex": 7,
      "gurmukhi": "ਚਮਕੰਤ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਣ ਪ੍ਰਭਾਨਿ ਮੜੀ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chamaka(n)t kirapaan prabhaan maRee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਜਿਸ ਦੇ ਹੱਥ ਵਿਚ) ਤਲਵਾਰ ਚਮਕਦੀ ਹੈ, (ਜੋ) ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਨਾਲ ਮੜ੍ਰਹੀ ਹੋਈ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "चमकंत कृपाण प्रभानि मड़ी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100049",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0008",
      "lineIndex": 8,
      "gurmukhi": "ਗਣਿ ਹੂਰ ਸੁ ਪੂਰਤ ਧੂਰਿ ਰਣੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "gan hoor su poorat dhoor rana(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੂਰਾ ਦੀਆਂ ਟੋਲੀਆਂ ਯੁੱਧ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚ ਧੂੜ ਨਾਲ ਭਰੀਆਂ ਪਈਆਂ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "गणि हूर सु पूरत धूरि रणं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100050",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0009",
      "lineIndex": 9,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਵਿਲੋਕਤ ਦੇਵ ਅਦੇਵ ਗਣੰ ॥੪੯੯॥",
      "transliteration": "avilokat dhev adhev gana(n) ||499||",
      "translation": "The goddess Chandi, riding on her lion, is shouting loudly and her glorious sword is gleaming, because of the ganas and heavenly damsels, the battlefield has become filled with dust and all the gods and demons are looking at this war.499.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਦੇਵਤਿਆਂ ਅਤੇ ਦੈਂਤਾ ਦੇ ਟੋਲੇ ਵੇਖ ਰਹੇ ਹਨ ॥੪੯੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अविलोकत देव अदेव गणं ॥४९९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100051",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0010",
      "lineIndex": 10,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਣਿ ਭਰਮਤ ਕ੍ਰੂਰ ਕਬੰਧ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ran bharamat kraoor kaba(n)dh prabhaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਭਿਆਨਕ ਸ਼ਕਲ ਵਾਲੇ ਧੜ ਰਣ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚ ਭਜੇ ਫਿਰਦੇ ਹਨ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रणि भरमत क्रूर कबंध प्रभा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100052",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0011",
      "lineIndex": 11,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਵਿਲੋਕਤ ਰੀਝਤ ਦੇਵ ਸਭਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "avilokat reejhat dhev sabhaa ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਜਿਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਨੂੰ) ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਦੇਵਤਿਆਂ ਦੀ ਸਭਾ ਰੀਝ ਰਹੀ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अविलोकत रीझत देव सभा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100053",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0012",
      "lineIndex": 12,
      "gurmukhi": "ਗਣਿ ਹੂਰਨ ਬ੍ਰਯਾਹਤ ਪੂਰ ਰਣੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "gan hooran brayaahat poor rana(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੂਰਾ ਦੀਆਂ ਟੋਲੀਆਂ ਰਣ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚ ਵਿਆਹ (ਦੀਆਂ ਰਸਮਾ) ਪੂਰੀਆਂ ਕਰ ਰਹੀਆਂ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "गणि हूरन ब्रयाहत पूर रणं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100054",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0013",
      "lineIndex": 13,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਥ ਥੰਭਤ ਭਾਨੁ ਬਿਲੋਕ ਭਟੰ ॥੫੦੦॥",
      "transliteration": "rath tha(n)bhat bhaan bilok bhaTa(n) ||500||",
      "translation": "Seeing the radiant headless trunks, roaming in the war-arena, the gods are becoming pleased, the warriors are wedding the heavenly damsels in the battlefield and seeing the warriors, the Sun-god is withholding his chariot.500.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਯੋਧਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖਣ ਲਈ ਸੂਰਜ ਨੇ ਰਥ ਨੂੰ ਰੋਕ ਲਿਆ ਹੈ ॥੫੦੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रथ थंभत भानु बिलोक भटं ॥५००॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100055",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0014",
      "lineIndex": 14,
      "gurmukhi": "ਢਢਿ ਢੋਲਕ ਝਾਝ ਮ੍ਰਿਦੰਗ ਮੁਖੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ddadd ddolak jhaajh miradha(n)g mukha(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਢੱਡ, ਢੋਲਕ, ਝਾਝ, ਮ੍ਰਿਦੰਗ, ਮੁਖਰਸ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ढढि ढोलक झाझ मृदंग मुखं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100056",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0015",
      "lineIndex": 15,
      "gurmukhi": "ਡਫ ਤਾਲ ਪਖਾਵਜ ਨਾਇ ਸੁਰੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ddaf taal pakhaavaj nai sura(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਡਫ, ਛੈਣੇ ('ਤਾਲ') ਤਬਲੇ ਅਤੇ ਸਰਨਾਈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "डफ ताल पखावज नाइ सुरं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100057",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੁਰ ਸੰਖ ਨਫੀਰੀਯ ਭੇਰਿ ਭਕੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sur sa(n)kh nafeereey bher bhaka(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੁਰੀ, ਸੰਖ, ਨਫ਼ੀਰੀ, ਭੇਰੀ ਤੇ ਭੰਕ (ਨਾ ਵਾਲੇ ਵਾਜੇ ਵਜਦੇ ਹਨ)।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सुर संख नफीरीय भेरि भकं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100058",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਉਠਿ ਨਿਰਤਤ ਭੂਤ ਪਰੇਤ ਗਣੰ ॥੫੦੧॥",
      "transliteration": "auTh niratat bhoot paret gana(n) ||501||",
      "translation": "The ghosts and fiends are dancing to the tune of drums, anklets, tabors, conche, fifes, kettledrums etc.501.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਭੂਤਾ ਪ੍ਰੇਤਾ ਦੇ ਗਣ ਉਠ ਉਠ ਕੇ ਨਾਚ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ ॥੫੦੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "उठि निरतत भूत परेत गणं ॥५०१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100059",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0018",
      "lineIndex": 18,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਿਸ ਪਛਮ ਜੀਤਿ ਅਭੀਤ ਨ੍ਰਿਪੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhis pachham jeet abheet nirapa(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪੱਛਮ ਦਿਸ਼ਾ ਦੇ ਨਿਡਰ ਰਾਜਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਜਿਤ ਲਿਆ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दिस पछम जीति अभीत नृपं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100060",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0019",
      "lineIndex": 19,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕੁਪਿ ਕੀਨ ਪਯਾਨ ਸੁ ਦਛਣਿਣੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kup keen payaan su dhachhanina(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੁਣ ਕ੍ਰੋਧ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਦੱਖਣ ਦਿਸ਼ਾ ਨੂੰ ਚਾਲੇ ਪਾਏ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कुपि कीन पयान सु दछणिणं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100061",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0020",
      "lineIndex": 20,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਰਿ ਭਜੀਯ ਤਜੀਯ ਦੇਸ ਦਿਸੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ar bhajeey tajeey dhes dhisa(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਵੈਰੀ ਦੇਸ਼ ਅਤੇ ਦਿਸ਼ਾਵਾ ਨੂੰ ਛਡ ਕੇ ਭਜ ਤੁਰੇ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अरि भजीय तजीय देस दिसं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100062",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0021",
      "lineIndex": 21,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਣ ਗਜੀਅ ਕੇਤਕ ਏਸੁਰਿਣੰ ॥੫੦੨॥",
      "transliteration": "ran gajeea ketak esurina(n) ||502||",
      "translation": "Conquering the fearless kings of the West, in anger, kalki marched forward towards the Souh, the enemies, leaving their countries, ran away and the warriors thundered in the battlefield.502.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕਿਤਨੇ ਹੀ ਰਾਜੇ ਰਣ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚ ਗਜ ਰਹੇ ਹਨ ॥੫੦੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रण गजीअ केतक एसुरिणं ॥५०२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100063",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0601_line_0022",
      "lineIndex": 22,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨ੍ਰਿਤ ਨ੍ਰਿਤਤ ਭੂਤ ਬਿਤਾਲ ਬਲੀ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirat niratat bhoot bitaal balee ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਭੂਤ ਅਤੇ ਬਲਵਾਨ ਬੈਤਾਲ ਨਚ ਰਹੇ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 601,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नृत नृतत भूत बिताल बली ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100064",
      "sourceShabadId": "9262",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
